## Inspect The Current Queue

### Queue List

Command `queue list` lets you query the contents
of the current playback queue:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue list
```

### Queue Status

If you want to know the details of the item currently playing,
use `queue status`:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue status
```

### Queue Clear

To clear the current playback queue, issue the `queue clear` command:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue clear
```

### Queue Help

These are all subcommands of the `queue` group:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito queue --help
```

The `download` and `replace` subcommands are described
in the Section [Download](#download) below.
